# Brief replies (portfolio)

- **Default:** Keep answers to **about 50 words** (roughly 2–4 short sentences). Count matters for casual/status questions and confirmations.
- **Expand only when** the user asks for detail, steps, lists, code review, deploy logs, or says “explain”, “how”, “why in full”, etc.
- **Do not** pad with follow-up offers every time; one direct question at the end is enough if something is blocked.
